OL,3,AMan completes 2,800 mile scoot across
OL,4,AAustralia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has completed a challenge to
OL,7,Fcross the width of Australia on a
OL,8,Fnon-electric kick scooter.
OL,10,FBob Brown from Saltash, Cornwall
OL,11,Fstarted his journey in July and
OL,12,Ftravelled about 2,800 miles (4506km)
OL,13,Ffrom Perth to Sydney, where he finished
OL,14,Fhis trip on Monday.
OL,16,FHe said he hoped to break two Guinness
OL,17,FWorld Records - to become the fastest
OL,18,Fperson to cross the country on a kick
OL,19,Fscooter, while also being the first to
OL,20,Ftravel the route by three different
OL,21,Fmethods, running, cycling, and
OL,22,Fscootering.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
