OL,3,AMan completes 2,800 mile scoot across
OL,4,AAustralia
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown said "after a lifetime packed
OL,7,Fwith adventure, at 57-years-old I
OL,8,Fwanted another epic adventure before I
OL,9,Fgot too old".
